<font size=2>[37]</font> <font size=4 color=#40c0c0> ヨミマシタ</font>
</td></table>
<table border=0 cellpadding=1 cellspacing=0 width=100%><td nowrap>
<font size=3 color=#606060><strong>▽</strong> 2006/03/08 (水) 14:05:22 <strong>▽</strong> 日本海 </font></td>
<td nowrap align=right><font size=3>　<a href="bbs@res_200603083140522_log_two_bit.cgi">返信</a>　削除<input type=checkbox name="target" value="200603083140522"></font>
</td></table>
<table border=0 cellpadding=16 cellspacing=0 width=100%><td>
